N5008 [over.match.class.deduct]/1.1, [temp.deduct.call]/3: the guide formed
from the constructor P(W<T> &&) deduces T = short from the prvalue
W<short>{3}.  The front end reported "missing type in template argument"
(bin53): deduce_class_template_arguments took an argument whose type was
still in parsed form (a cpp_name, possibly under a reference) as already
type-checked.  test_arguments.desc: a call result, an xvalue, functional
casts.
The lvalue-reference forms work (cpp17_ctad_constructor_reference_to_
template_id).  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this
program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
